{
  "name": "RAG Sync Monitor → Qdrant (only changed chunks)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "d3523d33-2f29-5023-8542-64fe8b638de2",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RAG Sync Monitor → Qdrant\n\nKeeps a Qdrant collection in sync with a docs site. Each run only embeds and writes the chunks that **changed**; removed content is deleted.\n\n**Setup (5 min)**\n1. Edit **Config**: `siteUrl`, `stateKey` (one per site), `qdrantUrl`, `collection`.\n2. Create 3 *Header Auth* credentials:\n   - **Apify**: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer <APIFY_TOKEN>`\n   - **OpenAI**: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer <OPENAI_API_KEY>`\n   - **Qdrant**: name `api-key`, value `<QDRANT_API_KEY>` (any value for a local Qdrant without auth)\n3. Click **Test workflow**. Run it again: only changes come through.\n4. Activate to run daily.\n\nThe Actor call waits up to 5 min, which suits sites up to a few hundred pages per run (raise `maxPages` gradually; unchanged pages are cheap).\nUses `text-embedding-3-small` (1536 dims). If you change the model, change `vectorSize` and use a new collection.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 460
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8622f997-7164-512f-b710-33a30574cc0f",
      "name": "Run manually",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
